reduce the pool of applicants below the point of usefulness.  

Third,in order to decide on this requirement, NASA employed an
ophthalmologist to make a study, thus incresing by one the number of its
employees.  As is well known, the primary purpose of NASA is to employ the
largest possible number of voters. 

 
